{"id":"n55947-1-8","stage":5,"title":"무럭무럭 · 茁壮","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55947-1-8-1","ko":"엄마, 콩나물은 먹기 싫어요.","zh":"妈妈，我不想吃豆芽。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"콩나물은","meaning":"黄豆芽，凉拌黄豆芽","explanation":"콩나물：黄豆芽，凉拌黄豆芽；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"콩나물","audio":"/audio/5f9bbbae4e8125a6dfcd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72172","senseId":"1","lemma":"콩나물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹기","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싫어요.","meaning":"不愿意，不想","explanation":"싫다：不愿意，不想；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"싫다","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57271","senseId":"2","lemma":"싫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"5f9bbbae4e8125a6","term":"콩나물","zh":"黄豆芽，凉拌黄豆芽","audio":"/audio/5f9bbbae4e8125a6dfcd.mp3","entryId":"72172","definition":"常作为素菜食用的植物，泡发颗粒饱满的黄豆，使其发芽后放在阴凉处，并浇水，使其长出芽根；或指用那种植物拌的凉菜。","pronunciation":["콩나물"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"2011ef2922f6c340","term":"싫다","zh":"不愿意，不想","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3","entryId":"57271","definition":"不情愿做某事。","pronunciation":["실타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0128e2610c7f330ea367.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55947-1-8-2","ko":"콩나물을 먹으면 무럭무럭 크는데, 안 먹을 거야?","zh":"吃豆芽的话能长得又高又壮，你就不打算吃了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"콩나물을","meaning":"黄豆芽，凉拌黄豆芽","explanation":"콩나물：黄豆芽，凉拌黄豆芽；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"콩나물","audio":"/audio/5f9bbbae4e8125a6dfcd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72172","senseId":"1","lemma":"콩나물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹으면","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무럭무럭","meaning":"茁壮","explanation":"무럭무럭：茁壮","readings":[{"term":"무럭무럭","audio":"/audio/8e451f1f07ef54689c9d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55947","senseId":"1","lemma":"무럭무럭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"크는데,","meaning":"长，成长，生长","explanation":"크다：长，成长，生长；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66584","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹을","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5f9bbbae4e8125a6","term":"콩나물","zh":"黄豆芽，凉拌黄豆芽","audio":"/audio/5f9bbbae4e8125a6dfcd.mp3","entryId":"72172","definition":"常作为素菜食用的植物，泡发颗粒饱满的黄豆，使其发芽后放在阴凉处，并浇水，使其长出芽根；或指用那种植物拌的凉菜。","pronunciation":["콩나물"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"8e451f1f07ef5468","term":"무럭무럭","zh":"茁壮","audio":"/audio/8e451f1f07ef54689c9d.mp3","entryId":"55947","definition":"顺利且壮实地成长的样子。","pronunciation":["무렁무럭"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"长，成长，生长","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66584","definition":"动植物长大。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/18f66c7aba9634b8f6fa.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.197,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55947","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":153,"sequenceScore":3.0237,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["妈妈，我不想吃豆芽。","吃豆芽的话能长得又高又壮，你就不打算吃了吗？","你怎么一周就要换一次发型啊？别总动你的头发了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，我不想吃豆芽。","吃豆芽的话能长得又高又壮，你就不打算吃了吗？","你怎么一周就要换一次发型啊？别总动你的头发了。"],"answer":1}]}
